@startuml Studio_Management_Admin_Seq

title Sequence Diagram - Management Booking Studio (Admin/Pengurus)

actor Admin
participant "Admin Panel" as Panel
participant System
database Database

Admin -> Panel: Buka dashboard booking
Panel -> Database: Query all bookings + statistics
Database --> Panel: Return bookings + stats
Panel --> Admin: Tampilkan dashboard

Admin -> Panel: Search booking (filter/search)
Panel -> Database: Query bookings dengan filter
Database --> Panel: Return filtered bookings
Panel --> Admin: Tampilkan hasil search

Admin -> Panel: Klik booking untuk detail
Panel -> Database: Query booking detail + customer info
Database --> Panel: Return detail
Panel --> Admin: Tampilkan booking detail

Admin -> Panel: Klik "Approve" pada pending booking
Panel -> System: Update booking status = confirmed
System -> Database: Save status change
System -> System: Send notification to customer
Panel --> Admin: Show success message

Admin -> Panel: Klik "Check In" pada confirmed booking
Panel -> System: Update status = in-progress
System -> Database: Save status change
Panel --> Admin: Show check in success

Admin -> Panel: Klik "Check Out" saat selesai
Panel -> System: Record checkout time
System -> System: Calculate actual duration
System -> System: Check for extra charges
System -> Database: Update status = completed
Panel --> Admin: Show receipt summary

Admin -> Panel: View booking reports
Panel -> Database: Aggregate booking data (by studio, by date, etc)
Database --> Panel: Return analytics
Panel --> Admin: Tampilkan charts + statistics

@enduml
